/target
/.dev-data
# The real database lives in the platform data directory (see src/paths.rs).
# This only appears if ROME_DATA_DIR is pointed at the repository root.
/rome.db

# Frames written by `just shots`. Output, not source: they are made to be looked
# at and would be stale in the repository the moment the design moved.
/shots

# `runtime/fake-host.py` is run by the plugin tests; this is Python's own cache
# of it, and it is a build artifact with a machine-specific path inside.
__pycache__/
